        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d47d847-c2dc-4f6d-b0e9-6d719560418e).Image",
        "Description": "A &quot;top&quot; German filmmaker is having trouble getting his new title released in his homeland. He feels that a newfound fear of terrorism could lead censors to accept the message of his &quot;masterpiece&quot;. Kill several targets with explosions in crowded areas of the Holle Nightclub. And do it wearing a ski mask so that witness reports support claims of terrorism.",
